    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dystopian world made of heaps of rubbish, making friends, taking on tough opponents at Mach 5, and befriending as many fluffs as physically possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique combat system based on momentum, so, the faster you go, the harder you hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, depending on who you fight and befriend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 2 fluffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Worlds to explore, with side quests giving lucrative rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup system with many unique runes, allowing you to create the ultimate setup</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dystopian world made of heaps of rubbish, making friends, taking on tough opponents at Mach 5, and befriending as many fluffs as physically possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique combat system based on momentum, so, the faster you go, the harder you hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, depending on who you fight and befriend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 2 fluffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Worlds to explore, with side quests giving lucrative rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup system with many unique runes, allowing you to create the ultimate setup</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Go faster, hit harder. Sky &amp; Soul is a story-driven platformer/adventure game, you wake up on a planet made of rubbish, meeting a strange race of fluffs, using various abilities to traverse the world at the fastest speed possible, to claim your spot among the stars.",
